Caregiver demo photos go here, named to match `imageUrl` in
src/lib/vocabulary/approvedVocabulary.ts — e.g. blue-cup.png, red-cup.png.

Files dropped here are picked up automatically: `npm run build` regenerates
src/lib/images/imageManifest.ts, and any catalog entry whose image now exists
starts rendering it. Until then those tiles show label + icon, which is the
intended fallback, not a bug.
